              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Nyoman kituyö kegh Erode nko Pontio Pilato nko pipö punton nko pipö Israel ompö kanasyantanete akïtagh Mötworintengu nyo tïlil, Yeso, nyo kikïlanyi le Masiya.* ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 4:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kituyö chane atökwigh kïgh anka tïkwïl nyo kitatanyi könyisyok, ompö owesyengu nko machatengu lö, igho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 4:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenyono ye nyu Echotyon, rose wölo otyeghenecha kïlïkwï, itö mötworiku, owesyö nko nyakanat nyo ngölono ngölyontengu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 4:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghïtenö ewungu kïsöpchö pich, aikany kwighisyö kiporut nko töngönchin ompö kaynata Yeso Mötworintengu nyo Tïlil.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
